<h2 class="text-primary">📩 Officer Invitation</h2>

<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  You have been invited to join <strong><%= @partner_name %></strong> 
  as an officer on BonID.
</p>

<p>
  Please click the link below to set up your account:
</p>

<p>
